A click handler calls this with 400 items (2 s in all). Does the page paint or react to input during those 2 s?
```js
async function processAll(items) {
  for (const it of items) {
    render(it); // about 5 ms
    await Promise.resolve();
  }
}
```

The same loop now awaits a timer between items. Does the page paint or react to input during the run?
```js
async function processAll(items) {
  for (const it of items) {
    render(it); // about 5 ms
    await new Promise((r) => setTimeout(r));
  }
}
```
